  "correct": "3",
  "solution": "[IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/f22f57d0cf5c493280a0ab6b7dbaea9e3fc5b035c6d410d59c2f476043bd03a8.png] \n\nGiven codes:\n\n \n \n\n Signs\n Code\n \n \n\n ÷ \n +\n \n \n\n +\n -\n \n \n\n -\n ×\n \n \n\n ×\n ÷\n \n \n\nBy putting values in option 1 by 1 using BODMAS rule \n\n1. 15 - 3 + 10 × 5 ÷ 5 = 46\n\nBy interchanging signs we get,\n\n15 × 3 - **10 ÷ 5 **+ 5 = 46\n\n**15 ×**** 3 **- 2 + 5 = 46\n\n**45 ****- 2 + 5 **= 46\n\n50 - 2 ≠ 46\n\n48 ≠ 46\n\n2. 15 - 3 + 10 × 5 ÷ 5 = 50\n\nBy interchanging signs we get,\n\n15 × 3 - **10 ÷ 5** + 5 = 50\n\n**15 ×**** 3 **- 2 + 5 = 50\n\n**45 - ****2 + 5 **= 50\n\n50 - 2 ≠ 50\n\n48 ≠ 50 \n\n**3. 15 - 3 + 10 × 5 ÷ 5 = 48**\n\nBy interchanging signs we get,\n\n15 × 3 - **10 ÷ 5 **+ 5 = 48\n\n**15 ×**** 3 **- 2 + 5 = 48\n\n**45 ****- 2 + 5 **= 48\n\n50 - 2 = 48\n\n**48 = 48**\n\n4. 15 - 3 + 10 × 5 ÷ 5 = 55\n\nBy interchanging signs we get,\n\n15 × 3 - **10 ÷ 5 **+ 5 = 55\n\n**15 ×**** 3** - 2 + 5 = 55\n\n**45 - ****2 + 5** = 55\n\n**50 - 2** = 55\n\n48 ≠ 55\n\nHence, the correct answer is** \"Option (3)\".**",
